# React Native Conventions

- Use functional components with hooks. No class components (except ErrorBoundary).
- Use `useColorScheme()` + `getColors(isDark)` for theme-aware styling.
- Prefer inline `style` objects for one-off styles; use NativeWind classes for reusable patterns.
- Use `expo-haptics` for tactile feedback on user actions.
- Use `react-native-reanimated` for gesture-driven animations, not `Animated` from RN core (except simple fades).
- All screens must handle safe areas via `SafeAreaProvider` or padding.
